This laboratory adapts the application/main/graphics_internal architecture from
https://github.com/vladeemerr/vulkan-starter-app (Apache-2.0).
Modified for laboratory 2, variant 8: cylinder geometry with procedural normals,
camera controls, Blinn-Phong materials, directional/point/spot lighting,
scene/model descriptor sets, light storage buffers and unlit light visualizations.
Build scripts and MoltenVK support enable macOS compilation and execution.
